<item>
  <title><a href="/PressRoom/PressReleases/7911-19" hreflang="en">CFTC Chairman Gives Remarks at FSB Meeting on LIBOR Reform</a></title>
  <link>https://www.cftc.gov/PressReleases/7911-19</link>
  <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC) Chairman J. Christopher Giancarlo joined Randal K. Quarles, Chair of the Financial Stability Board (FSB) and Vice Chairman of Supervision, Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System, UK Financial Conduct Authority CEO Andrew Bailey, and Deputy Governor Bank of England Sir David Ramsden for an FSB Roundtable discussion to highlight the need for continued progress to reform major interest rate benchmarks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;


Released: &lt;time datetime="52Z"&gt;04/11/2019&lt;/time&gt;</description>
